 ## Native prompt overlay successor
 
 This successor uses only the frozen UIv3 prompt overlay product. The observer follows the actual delayed DrawPromptWindow callback and retains every prior real input/command/physical assertion. Review actual screenshots: the human Italian edge prompt and robot source-selection cancellation line must remain readable over lower native HUD/gizmo rows. Viewport geometry alone does not establish rendering acceptance. No new backend or provider scope.
+
